Third-party components

Kupferdraht links and compiles third-party components under permissive
licenses, vendors the SQLite3 Multiple Ciphers amalgamation (MIT) with
SQLite (public domain), and uses a few components at build time only.
The complete list with licenses, authors and repositories is
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES; the license texts are docs/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.html.

Kupferdraht's public API follows the conceptual model of matrix-rust-sdk
(Apache-2.0, https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-rust-sdk); no code was
taken from it.

